Phase 5 item 4 (review surface): hunk-level accept/reject with durable events — E2E proof
Date: 2026-09-11  Commit: dd1057d

Scope proven (through production dispatch CoreServices::handle, real git worktree, real event store):
1. GetDiffHunks lists the changed hunks of the task worktree keyed by new-file
   start line, diffed against the task BASE revision (not worktree HEAD —
   agents commit on their branch).
2. ResolveReviewHunk(accepted=false) inverse-applies ONLY the selected hunk
   (git apply --reverse --unidiff-zero) in the real worktree: line 2 reverted,
   line 4 edit retained (byte-exact file assertion).
3. ResolveReviewHunk(accepted=true) records the decision without mutating the
   worktree.
4. Both decisions are durable review_hunk_resolved events on the task
   aggregate with inline payload (path/new_start/accepted asserted).

Implementation: proto surface.proto oneof 22/23 (+DiffHunksView/DiffHunkView);
domain CommandPayload::ResolveReviewHunk -> DomainEvent::ReviewHunkResolved
(state-neutral in the task lifecycle machine); event-store lifecycle mapping;
core-runtime surface.rs review_repo/diff_hunks/resolve_review_hunk;
modbit-git diff_hunks_from/parse_hunks/reject_hunk (digit-run new_start
extraction for -U0 headers with trailing context).

